            "detailed_description": "All Hell Has Broken Loose!!!  The Haunted is a fast paced third person action horror game that focuses on delivering an intense multiplayer experience. Your goal is to liberate cursed places and survive the assault from the minions of Hell. The game features several multiplayer modes such as co-op survival, demons vs. humans and demonizer.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Addictive cooperative online and offline gameplay for up to 4 players!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Multiplayer versus mode! Humans vs Demons in exhilarating and distinct game modes “Battle” and “Demonizer”. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>8 larger environments with unique level events such as meteor showers and lightning storms which affect the gameplay. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Over 30 upgradeable weapons and hidden special weapons and items.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Custom level and modification support!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Powered by Unreal Engine.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "All Hell Has Broken Loose!!!  The Haunted is a fast paced third person action horror game that focuses on delivering an intense multiplayer experience. Your goal is to liberate cursed places and survive the assault from the minions of Hell. The game features several multiplayer modes such as co-op survival, demons vs. humans and demonizer.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Addictive cooperative online and offline gameplay for up to 4 players!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Multiplayer versus mode! Humans vs Demons in exhilarating and distinct game modes “Battle” and “Demonizer”. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>8 larger environments with unique level events such as meteor showers and lightning storms which affect the gameplay. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Over 30 upgradeable weapons and hidden special weapons and items.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Custom level and modification support!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Powered by Unreal Engine.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Vencedor do concurso &quot;Make Something Unreal&quot; em 2010, The Haunted: Hells Reach é um jogo de terror acelerado onde o seu objetivo é liberar os lugares amaldiçoados e sobreviver ao assalto do Inferno.",
